        "scored. Points only: no token, no value, no airdrop.</p>"
        "<h2>Start (5 commands)</h2><pre>git clone https://github.com/gasangalimov/ARES-PROTOCOL &amp;&amp; cd ARES-PROTOCOL\n"
        "pip install httpx==0.28.1 pycryptodome==3.23.0     # Python 3.12+, Rust + wasm32-unknown-unknown\n"
        "python3 lite/cli/play.py join --server SERVER_URL\n"
        "python3 lite/cli/play.py build &amp;&amp; python3 lite/cli/play.py score\n"
        "python3 lite/cli/play.py submit                       # then edit lib.rs and repeat</pre>"
        "<p>Using an AI agent? Give it <code>season-play/AGENT_BRIEF.md</code> (also served at <code>/agent.md</code>).</p>",
        "<h2>Rules</h2><ul>",
        f"<li>Challenge: CODE-SYNTH v0 <b>GRAPH-ROUTE</b>, difficulty profile {manifest.difficulty_index}. "
        "Task: lexicographically smallest (cost, edge path) walk of ≤ hop_limit edges from source to target "
        "that avoids the forbidden class, stays within the resource budget and uses the required class.</li>",
        f"<li>Correctness gate: frozen <code>verify_reveal</code> must return TEST_VALID on all 20 solution-bound "
        f"hidden tests for each of {r.seed_count} post-close seeds.</li>",
        f"<li>Score: total fuel over {r.benchmark_cases} shared hidden cases derived from the post-close beacon "
        "(same cases for everyone). Lower is better.</li>",
        f"<li>Rewards (devnet units): in commit order, a valid solver whose score beats the best so far by at least "
