        f"Season cap {r.season_cap:,}. Copies and equal scores earn 0; splitting an improvement never pays more.</li>",
        "<li>Practice board below uses <i>public</i> seeds: useful feedback, never used for rewards.</li></ul>",
        "<h2>Challenge</h2><div class='wrap'><table>",
        f"<tr><th>challenge_id</th><td><code>{esc(challenge['challenge_id'])}</code></td></tr>",
        f"<tr><th>manifest hash</th><td><code>{esc(manifest.manifest_hash().hex())}</code></td></tr>",
        "".join(f"<tr><th>{esc(k)}</th><td>{esc(v)}</td></tr>" for k, v in zip(challenge["task_spec_fields"], challenge["task_spec"])),
        "</table></div>",
        f"<details><summary>public examples ({len(challenge['public_examples'])})</summary><pre>{esc(json.dumps(challenge['public_examples']))}</pre></details>",
        "<h2>Starter kit &amp; baseline</h2>",
        "<p>The baseline is the pinned generic source <code>lite/solvers/graph_route/src/lib.rs</code> "
